- Web search (Bing, DuckDuckGo blocked): no third-party coverage of "Reflection AI Beam 1.0" — zero results for the base-model name.

A future re-research should look for (a) a public Reflection AI vendor surface or model card for beam-1.0-501b-a23b, (b) aggregator coverage (BenchLM/AA) once the stealth window closes, (c) documented context/output limits, (d) post-promo per-token pricing — then write a fresh `GLM_5.3.md`.

